        "start": 120.67,
        "end": 123.409,
        "text": "那下面就来说一些客观事实了，第一个就是更新频率",
        "representativeTime": 122.04,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-040.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-010"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-041",
        "start": 123.409,
        "end": 127.46,
        "text": "因为我对你来说只有两个要求，第一个就是不要断更，第二个点就是要以一个",
        "representativeTime": 125.434,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-041.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-010",
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-042",
        "start": 127.47,
        "end": 128.75,
        "text": "正常规律的更新频率",
        "representativeTime": 128.11,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-042.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-043",
        "start": 128.75,
        "end": 130.599,
        "text": "比如说如果你是月更博主的话",
        "representativeTime": 129.674,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-043.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-044",
        "start": 130.599,
        "end": 132.733,
        "text": "你肯定不会一个月不更新就算断更",
        "representativeTime": 131.666,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-044.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-045",
        "start": 132.733,
        "end": 137.43,
        "text": "但如果你是月更博主的话，你一个月不更新就算断更了，然后活跃就是太多",
        "representativeTime": 135.082,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-045.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011",
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-046",
        "start": 137.44,
        "end": 139.173,
        "text": "所谓懂自媒体的人写割韭菜了",
        "representativeTime": 138.306,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-046.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-047",
        "start": 139.173,
        "end": 140.373,
        "text": "我可以负责任告诉你",
        "representativeTime": 139.773,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-047.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-048",
        "start": 140.373,
        "end": 141.573,
        "text": "如果你的内容足够好",
        "representativeTime": 140.973,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-048.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-049",
        "start": 141.573,
        "end": 146.51,
        "text": "养号和活跃根不存在，不过第四点就是投流，投流只负责锦上添花，不负责雪中送炭",
        "representativeTime": 144.041,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-049.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-050",
        "start": 146.52,
        "end": 150.095,
        "text": "你一条屎一样的视频，你投再多流也没有任何意义，那么这个商业引流呢",
        "representativeTime": 148.308,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-050.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012",
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-051",
        "start": 150.095,
        "end": 153.67,
        "text": "我们指的不是那些先有产业再有账号的博主，而是那些以广告为生的博主",
        "representativeTime": 151.882,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-051.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-052",
        "start": 153.68,
        "end": 158.31,
        "text": "为什么我说颜值博主和那些手势舞博主擦边博主最不赚钱的，一点广告位都没有",
        "representativeTime": 155.995,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-052.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-053",
        "start": 158.31,
        "end": 163.073,
        "text": "怎么赚钱啊，唉，今天就先讲到这里了，我是人类最强编导woman，下期再见",
        "representativeTime": 160.692,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-053.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
